WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 17 - Wuthering Heights

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.630
"It's me, Catherine!"

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.510
"A ghost?"

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.600
"It says that it's Catherine!"

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:59.470
"Catherine, it's me! Here I am!"

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:00.980
"Come in, Cathy!"

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.230
"Do come,

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:04.880
my Cathy!"

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:16.100
He must have come to watch Maya.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.160
Green Room 3

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.830
Are you ready, Maya?

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.880
You're almost on!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.560
A girl wild with intensity.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.390
Catherine!

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.300
I'm putting on...

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:42.540
Catherine Earnshaw's mask!

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:49.570
My story starts more than thirty years ago.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:52.090
Back then, Wuthering Heights...

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:56.590
was filled with warmth and the sound of laughter.

00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:03.470
One day, our Master picked up that accursed child...

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.500
It's Father! He has returned!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.630
Welcome home, Father!

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:27.720
Ryou...

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.060
Good morning, everyone!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.930
This is Heathcliff. I bestowed that name upon him this morning.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:37.840
You must e'en take it as a gift of God, so Hindley and Cathy,

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.750
you must treat him as one of our own.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.170
Why must I treat him so?!

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:47.570
You... You're really dirty, aren't you?

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:51.330
You may be dark, but when you're clean-skinned, you resemble the son of a nobleman!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.420
Is that really shy little Maya?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.680
Be damned!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:04.190
Why must Father scold me instead of <i>you</i>?

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.340
What an obstinate lout!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.720
He never utters a word!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.840
I'm impressed that you took his reproach without so much as a peep!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:36.090
From that point on, Catherine and Heathcliff became thick as thieves.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:41.010
When Heathcliff was with Catherine, he transformed into a different person,

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:46.680
and their hearts grew close in their time at Wuthering Heights.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.420
You are nothing but a horse thief!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.520
I only borrowed your colt for a ride...

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.800
Rogue!

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:55.080
You have our father in the palm of your hand!

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.420
Every harsh word my father rains down on me is your fault!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.120
Stop, Hindley!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:06.100
When Father dies and I become Master, I shall make you my slave!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.540
You're a dog! Imp of Satan!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.210
Cathy, step aside.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.740
How <i>dare</i> you treat her like that?!

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.530
Let me go, Heathcliff!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.510
Oh... my lip!

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:41.720
Ryou!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.200
What should I do? I...

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:53.710
What should I do? Cathy would....

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:55.760
Cathy would...

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:08.310
Heathcliff! You are truly Herculean, aren't you?

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:11.330
I admire that trait in you...

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:18.070
Let's retreat to the moors!

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.690
Catch me if you can!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:20.850
Wait!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.950
Nobody has ever loved me before...

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:32.680
And I have never loved anyone before, but you're different!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:36.500
You're the only companion I have in this world...

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.720
Cathy!

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:48.520
Not bad! I didn't think they'd be this intense!

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:51.520
Those kids are better than I expected.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.590
They're commanding the stage.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:56.260
Cathy!

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.680
My everything!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.140
My soul!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.110
I can't live...

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.030
without a soul!

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:07.910
Ever since she was a young girl, Cathy was in love with him.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.050
Heathcliff!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.480
I'm coming, Cathy!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.120
Was she supposed to rip her skirt as part of the act?

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.030
No, that wasn't meant to happen.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:18.020
Hurry up and change! You're almost on!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.530
How could you do something so rash?

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:24.060
Yes, how could you do something so rash?

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.570
An intense yet kind Cathy...

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.110
I've never met a girl like this before.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:33.640
And then, two or three years passed.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.640
Both Lady and Master passed away...

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:43.470
And from that day forward, Heathcliff set out on the path that led to his dark fate...

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:49.270
Now that my father is dead, you are my slave.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:53.280
You shall call me "Master" and my sister will be known as "Mistress Catherine."

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:58.230
And you are not to associate yourself with this servant, do you understand?

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.100
Let go of me!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:01.540
Cathy!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:08.640
I hate you! Nobody can stop me from being with Heathcliff!

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.900
I won't let go!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:10.890
No!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.180
Heathcliff!

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.670
Heathcliff!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:28.340
Heathcliff! Let's play on our moors!

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:34.690
Let's go to our moors!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.510
Heathcliff!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:38.520
Cathy!

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:41.200
What a Catherine.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.490
She's unpredictable, wild and headstrong...

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.540
yet you also get the feeling that she's pure and monogamous.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.520
Her acting isn't that spectacular in itself...

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:52.500
but there's an aura of passion surrounding her!

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:56.340
But this play is supposed to be about <i>us</i>!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.980
We're not supposed to be upstaged by our young selves!

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:15.790
Heathcliff... I'd wager your father is a King in the Eastern lands...

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:19.180
Your mother is an Indian princess and rich beyond compare.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.690
Hey...

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:30.370
You were whisked away by pirates when you were a babe and our father brought you to this place.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.760
I'm sure of it!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:32.400
Maya...

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.560
That's how you come to be at Wuthering Heights and...

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.350
She's not even looking at the audience...

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.110
She only has eyes for Heathcliff!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.020
Heathcliff!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:47.550
When you leave this place and find your own riches, be sure to return to me!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.600
How wonderful that would be!

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.620
Heathcliff!

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:56.650
I can't tear myself away from her eyes.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:01.700
Cathy... if that's your wish, then...

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.380
What's going on? Heathcliff's rooted to the spot!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.160
They've both frozen!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:11.220
What do they think they're doing? They should be using expansive gestures!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.590
Can't you feel the intensity between them in their stillness?

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.600
That's the love they share: naive yet pure!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:24.250
I <i>am</i> Heathcliff. And you are me.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:29.680
Cathy, I am you. We share the same soul.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.640
Promise me this, Cathy:

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:35.390
promise me you will never change even when you grow up.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.830
And I shall also stay the same.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:37.960
So please...

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:39.280
Please never change who you are.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.680
I promise, Heathcliff!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.280
Cathy, what's wrong?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.060
Mr. Hayami?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.580
If you really love her, you should watch to the end.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.090
That's exactly why I don't want to watch!

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.790
If you truly love her, go back to your seat.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.720
Watch to the end.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:07.010
What do you know about anything anyway?!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.030
You don't have a clue about how I feel, so who are you to give me advice?

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.620
Excuse me.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.190
I'm sorry. That was out of line.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.260
I promise!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.370
What will you do now, Mr. Masumi?

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.330
The car awaits you outside.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.810
The car can leave. You may leave as well.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.090
And you, sir?

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.100
I'm going to watch the play to the final curtain.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:42.950
Cathy, as long as you remain at Wuthering Heights, I will also stay here.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:46.520
No matter what! I'll support you.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.980
Heathcliff...

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:53.570
We shall be together forever!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:06.650
Good job everyone!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.830
You did a great job with Heathcliff, Mr. Kaga!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:14.900
I wanted to congratulate you on <i>Wuthering Heights</i>! A resounding success!

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.000
Thank you!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.490
I was particularly impressed with the young actors...

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:24.400
I realize they were only a small part of the story, especially Catherine,

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:27.800
yet, she was so passionate. The whole audience were entranced by her!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.820
Hey, where's Maya?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.550
What are you doing back there?

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.250
Come out here!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.560
Yes, sir! But, well...

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:43.980
You're a completely different person when you're not on stage...

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.060
Maya!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.190
Rei! Everyone!

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.940
We watched the whole thing, Maya. It was great!

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.750
Was Sakurakouji there too?

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.110
He was there at the beginning...

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.390
But he left halfway through...

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.670
Halfway through?

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:30.710
Why, Sakurakouji?

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:37.430
Are you looking for Heathcliff, Cathy?

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.280
You did very well...

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:44.260
I was particularly in awe of the scene where Cathy throws a tantrum,

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.340
when they try to separate her from Heathcliff.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Thank you, I guess.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.090
Like a little girl who wants her favorite toy.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.790
He <i>knows</i>.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.060
How old are you, little one?

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.320
Fifteen.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.500
Hm... not just yet, then.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:10.530
Grow up soon, you hear me, little one?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:13.060
That's <i>not</i> my name!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:16.040
I know, little one.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.810
Right, the cleaning is done! See you all tomorrow!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.080
Hey, Maya! Wait up!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.130
I guess she's gone.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:40.970
She said she had a show starting at six.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.760
<i>Her</i>?!

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.540
I'm surprised she's even got a job...

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.220
I'd like you all to go and get ready...

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:04.130
Once she puts on her costume, she becomes a completely different person.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.850
You wouldn't even recognize her.

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:12.650
Let's go to our moors,

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:14.140
Heathcliff!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.350
Cathy!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.810
But it's in the middle of the play!

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.100
Oh my!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.360
That was the fifth day of the performance.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:39.520
Is there truth in the rumor that you plan to elope with my sister?

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:43.830
You would do so even though she's done no wrong?

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.520
But you are not!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.880
Then punish me instead!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.660
As time passed,

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:54.440
the audience became more and more confused by the two roles.

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:58.920
Compared to the innocent but passionate love of Heathcliff and Catherine as children,

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:04.500
the love between their adult counterparts seemed lackluster: a mere shadow of its former self.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.240
That's Ryou Majima's girlfriend. Do you know that she's been here for every performance?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:13.580
She must be worried! I mean, it's only a play, but Majima seems to be falling in love with Catherine!

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.030
Then, the day of the final performance arrived.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:22.290
Maya, I just had to come and see you.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.560
Have you even noticed that Majima is in love with you?

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:32.740
I don't know how you feel, but the part of you that loves Majima's Heathcliff...

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.530
Heathcliff, don't go!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:47.650
Maya, why did you ask me to come and watch this play?

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.800
Do you know how painful it was for me to see you in love with another man?!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.320
But I'm sure you hadn't even considered that,

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.820
and that's what depresses me most.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:07.100
Could I have your autograph please?

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:09.620
The young Catherine was very good!

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.770
Heathcliff was wonderful too!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.790
My, my, aren't they popular?

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.990
Miss Kitajima? These are for you!

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.740
Purple roses?!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:23.970
You made it to the final show! Good job!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.860
How's your tutor's health?

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:31.730
I hope she'll be able to start teaching you again soon!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.820
From Your Fan.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.750
Thank you for everything you do, Mr. or Mrs. Purple Rose!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:42.970
You want to see Maya Kitajima? We're not letting any fans in, I'm afraid.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.140
Oh...

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.970
It's started snowing.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.430
Looks like it's gonna stick too.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.640
Maya...

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.690
Here you go...

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.700
This is for me?

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:03.770
A boy left it for you. He looked like he was in high school.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:04.700
Yuu

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.930
Sakurakouji!

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.430
What's wrong, Sakurakouji?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.810
Why didn't you wait for me?

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:21.780
And you left halfway through the opening night too!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:23.280
Why?

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.530
He used to be so kind, too...

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.180
Sakurakouji...

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:59.520
He's still kind...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.910
Wuthering Heights

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.380
Catherine: Maya Kitajima

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.140
Sir...

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.380
I wanted to congratulate you on the play.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.390
Sir?

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.570
A play?!

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:21.350
Yeah, our troupe is going to put on a play!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.860
We'll all be able to perform together again?!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.550
That's fantastic!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.520
It's called <i>The Stone's Smile</i>, but before I announce the roles...

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.970
I'd like everyone to step this way.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.560
Hey!

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:37.050
Ikkakujuu?!

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.550
It's good to see you all again!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:43.050
The Ikkakujuu Troupe will be helping us out.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:45.630
So, we'll be performing together?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.220
You got it in one. We're looking forward to it!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:50.320
So are we! Thank you for coming!

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:53.620
You're as short as I remember!

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:55.990
A flop!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:59.720
All the papers are saying the same thing!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.430
Don't tell me you hadn't noticed...

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:08.140
the horrible transition from the young characters to the adult ones.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.250
That little girl left too much of an impression on the audience!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.440
Maya Kitajima!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:19.330
As an actress, she's still inexperienced and definitely not someone who should be on stage.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:23.430
Because if she is, she'll upstage everyone else!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:33.330
I know the play is over but I can't stop thinking about her.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.560
Heathcliff!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:35.830
Cathy!

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:42.100
Cathy, I don't want to carry on like this!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.240
And now, I will announce the roles!

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:49.630
The lead role of Frederica will be played by Mina Sawatari.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:50.570
Thank you.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:55.140
The ambitious and vocal noblewoman, Isabella, will be played by Taiko Kasuga.

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.480
Ambitious and vocal noblewoman?!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:01.840
Rei Aoki will play Pio, an Italian crook.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:06.290
She will also play the peerless beauty, Victoria.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.730
Sayaka Minazuki will play three roles: wealthy Marissa,

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:14.330
Hannah the maid, and the mysterious old woman.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.020
What about Maya?

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.870
This time, Maya's role...

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:24.010
will be to sit absolutely motionless in the middle of the stage.

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:29.400
You have no lines nor movements and you don't need to make any facial expressions.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:32.250
I want you to sit still and be silent.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:39.350
B-But what kind of role is that for Maya, making her sit still the whole way through?

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:41.680
This time, Maya will be playing...

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.810
a doll.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:47.540
A-A doll?!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
Asa kara yoru made yoru kara asa made

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
From morning until night, from dusk till dawn,

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
Futari ai no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
you can feel the warmth of our love.

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
Shunkashuutou mo ippun ichibyou mo

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
All year round, every minute and every second,

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
Futari hada no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
you can feel the warmth of our skin.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
Kono dokidoki wa makka ni moeru taiyou

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
This excitement is burning brightly like the sun,

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
Atsuku moete atsuku togashite

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
let us burn brightly, let us burn until we're hot

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
Koi wo shimashou!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
and make love!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Sunao na mama dakiaou!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Let's hold and be true to each other!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
Isso mekimeki nekki! mekimeki daisuki!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
And let's add more heat! I love the heat!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Aishiae!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Feel the love!

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:26.210
This time, my role consists entirely of sitting on stage and doing absolutely nothing.

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:31.190
I wish I could have lines and act like everyone else!

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:35.220
I wonder why Ms. Tsukikage is making me play the role of a doll.

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:39.010
When you're trying to sit still for any length of time, it's only human to let your mind wander.

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:42.440
I guess that's the point:

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:46.240
dolls don't have souls.

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:51.510
Episode 18 - The Role of the Doll

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:50.000
How can you play a character that has no soul?
